{"overview":"عشق پرشور پیانیست سباحت و بکر زمانی قطع می‌شود که او بی‌ردپایی ناپدید می‌شود. سال‌ها بعد سرنوشت آن‌ها را دوباره به هم می‌رساند و می‌فهمند که نه زمان، نه فاصله و نه زندگی‌ای که سباحت ساخته است می‌تواند پیوندشان را بشکند. آن‌ها با هم سفری را آغاز می‌کنند که مرزهای عشق، وفاداری و فداکاری را به چالش می‌کشد، زیرا برخی عشق‌ها شایستهٔ مبارزه هستند، هرچه باشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The passionate love between pianist Sebahat and Bekir is cut short when he vanishes without a trace. Years later, when fate reunites them, they realize that neither time, distance, nor the life Sebahat has built could ever break their bond. Together, they embark on a journey that pushes the very limits of love, loyalty, and sacrifice because some loves are worth fighting for, no matter what.","tagline_en":"","runtime":122,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Özcan Deniz"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Öykü Karayel","role":"Canan","photo":"/rzMUT2OMgnlsDLKUIdPDM0q2mgf.jpg"},{"name":"Özcan Deniz","role":"Bekir","photo":"/1xugZDdp0vskwozHBSTCIFQPjCV.jpg"},{"name":"Nejat İşler","role":"","photo":"/xFhmBekB2odhRY335lJ6rWiIdyw.jpg"},{"name":"Helin Kandemir","role":"","photo":"/9ivMPksoFlRaL1eKRTZu4mkScOQ.jpg"},{"name":"Gonca Vuslateri","role":"","photo":"/wu2gvPyKKAGEVn1VX5WmHJ5szYI.jpg"},{"name":"Tilbe Saran","role":"","photo":"/ciN8qfqgII8T45jAAspqv722qXZ.jpg"},{"name":"Özgür Emre Yıldırım","role":"","photo":"/pekejv4I94Hp1UbLq3G3ksf3jkB.jpg"},{"name":"Ceyda Düvenci","role":"","photo":"/1lmyMdhQCPuxo8gIjwLpZTUwEza.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1561834-son-yemek/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1561834-son-yemek/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","lo